{"title":"Talent Swallowing Magician","synopsis":"Elric Melvinger Pewaris kekuasan dari keluarga sihir terkemuka Dia tidak memiliki Talent dari lahir sebagai akibatnya dia tidak bisa mempelajari ilmu sihir namun dia mendapatkan Blessing dari leluhurnya.\n\nMakan Demon\nTelan Demon\n\nAkan aku Kumpulkan Sebanyakbanyaknya demon dalam diriku dan dapatkan Sihir baru.\nAku akan bertambah kuat.\n\nSangat kuat sampai tidak ada yang mampu mengalahkanku.","alternative_title":"The Mage Who Absorbs Abilities | Demon Devourer | 재능 삼킨 마법사 | Mago Traga-Talentos","author":"Younggeun (Story Plus), Bread squirrel (빵먹는다람쥐","artist":"GRAPHICTORY","genres":["Action","Demon","Drama","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"6ec3c4fc-8836-4a20-bfe5-c9b03ce7467b","number":"148","title":"Chapter 148","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"id":"d4969f1d-51eb-4949-b014-86ae7691e648","number":"147","title":"Chapter 147","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"id":"eac47a1b-c4c3-4580-8920-29783becdada","number":"146","title":"Chapter 146","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"id":"cca2475d-8b17-4e01-81eb-887dc6cf5b59","number":"145","title":"Chapter 145","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"id":"5dc3894b-8046-4122-8f97-76236d23aefe","number":"144","title":"Chapter 144","date":"2026-05-26","images":[]},{"id":"a35d1e82-819f-47af-be76-d96eac45707c","number":"143","title":"Chapter 143","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"id":"2e726219-1ccb-4091-8e2f-a813a2a69b59","number":"142","title":"Chapter 142","date":"2026-05-12","images":[]},{"id":"7bb16f5a-cabb-4ced-bf30-4b6f45505058","number":"141","title":"Chapter 141","date":"2026-05-05","images":[]},{"id":"4ee671fd-5661-4c90-9bbf-d308d085b225","number":"140","title":"Chapter 140","date":"2026-04-28","images":[]},{"id":"7598ddc6-b831-43ae-ba1d-e9ef0648cfb9","number":"139","title":"Chapter 139","date":"2026-04-21","images":[]},{"id":"d230b3d1-6bd8-45bf-8c27-27013e7da03e","number":"138","title":"Chapter 138","date":"2026-04-14","images":[]},{"id":"7e62d9bb-13f7-43dd-bf7f-45c2f923d2